{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"surrogate-model-gp","title":"代理模型与高斯过程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations/surrogate-model-gp","wordCount":1998,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"acquisition-functions","title":"采集函数设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations/acquisition-functions","wordCount":1836,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"exploration-exploitation","title":"探索与利用平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations/exploration-exploitation","wordCount":2202,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础理论\n\n本章建立贝叶斯优化的三大理论支柱。首先通过代理模型与高斯过程，理解如何用有限的观测数据构建对未知目标函数的概率信念；然后深入采集函数的设计原理，掌握如何将不确定性转化为可优化的决策信号；最后在探索与利用的框架下，理解为什么不能只贪心选择当前最优、也不能只追逐不确定性，以及各种策略如何在这两者之间取得平衡。三篇文档互相支撑——代理模型提供预测和不确定性估计，采集函数消费这些估计做出决策，探索-利用理论则为采集函数的行为提供统一的解释视角。\n"}